{
	"info": {
		"name": "decidiq-long-term-agenda-tracks",
		"description": "planning-long-term-agenda-tracks-and-report, task 1 (REQ-LTAT-001): a planned agenda item can be a track under a topic, and the topic counts its tracks through declared aggregations. Seeds one governance body, the topic \"Energietransitie\" and its two tracks (mirroring the municipality profile seed), reads openTrackCount 2, lists the body's topics only, realises one track, reads openTrackCount 1, and tears everything down. baseUrl, adminUser and adminPass come from the environment (tests/newman/run-all.sh passes them); there is no default instance.",
